  "description": "Well-presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment available to rent at Aldborough Court, North Strand Road, Dublin 1.\n\nThe property is presented in good condition throughout and offers bright, comfortable accommodation in a highly convenient city location.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a spacious open-plan living/dining area with a fully fitted modern kitchen, two double bedrooms, and two bathrooms, including an en-suite bathroom.\n\nThe apartment benefits from tiled flooring throughout the main living area, wooden flooring in the bedrooms, modern kitchen units with integrated appliances, and contemporary bathroom finishes. Both bedrooms offer good proportions and plenty of space for comfortable city living.\n\nLocated on North Strand Road, the property enjoys excellent access to Dublin City Centre, IFSC, Connolly Station and East Point Business Park, with a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and public transport links within easy reach.",
